Dialogue: 7,0:21:37.40,0:21:38.76,Caption-CN,,0,0,0,,在妳被迫改变前
Dialogue: 7,0:21:39.51,0:21:41.74,Caption-CN,,0,0,0,,外表很重要
Dialogue: 7,0:21:44.28,0:21:47.02,Caption-CN,,0,0,0,,要记得微笑
Dialogue: 7,0:21:52.22,0:21:53.65,Caption-CN,,0,0,0,,（微笑）
Dialogue: 7,0:21:58.56,0:21:59.62,Caption-CN,,0,0,0,,（吸气声）
Dialogue: 7,0:22:00.27,0:22:00.99,Caption-CN,,0,0,0,,（沉重的脚步声）
