Dialogue: 6,0:21:36.46,0:21:37.40,Caption-JP,,0,19,48,,{\fs66\fsp-0.25}変革せよ｡
Dialogue: 6,0:21:37.40,0:21:38.76,Caption-JP,,0,26,48,,{\fs66\fsp-0.25}変革を迫られる前に
Dialogue: 6,0:21:39.51,0:21:41.74,Caption-JP,,0,32,48,,{\fs66\fsp-0.25}外見は大切だ
Dialogue: 6,0:21:44.28,0:21:47.02,Caption-JP,,0,22,48,,{\fs66\fsp-0.25}笑顔を忘れぬよう
Dialogue: 5,0:21:32.85,0:21:35.82,Caption-JP,,0,0,0,,Solemnity is the shield of idiots.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:36.46,0:21:37.40,Caption-JP,,0,0,0,,Change.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:37.40,0:21:38.76,Caption-JP,,0,0,0,,Before you have to.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:39.51,0:21:41.74,Caption-JP,,0,0,0,,Appearances matter.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:44.28,0:21:47.02,Caption-JP,,0,0,0,,And remember to smile.
